      "statement": "Idempotency is driven by a per-recording sidecar manifest <name>.transcriber_state.json managed in transcriber/state.py; the manifest, not artifact existence alone, is the source of truth for stage completion, and the orchestrator marks each stage complete immediately after it finishes so a crash between stages leaves an accurate manifest for the next retry.",
