    {
      "id": "claim_7b2162b981ab40daa9e0e86bef30d042",
      "statement": "S3 sync (transcriber/publish/s3.py) is a gated stage that runs aws s3 sync as a duct child process with a configurable timeout and is a no-op when disabled or when config.s3 is None; the orchestrator sequences sync before cleanup, and cleanup (transcriber/cleanup.py) deletes intermediates only on full success while preserving the .mp4, .md summary, .txt transcript, and .lides-clean.md.",
